{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Third plan review BLOCK remediation (2026-08-10): explicitly split `test_ticket_state_show_list_search` so search validates against SEARCH_RESULT, add a public `SearchResult` TypedDict and overload `rebar.search` so `full=False` returns SearchResult while `full=True` returns TicketState, and pin the live-store measurement to `SupportsIncremental` with a <25,000-byte ceiling. These are contract bookkeeping refinements; the intended behavior is unchanged."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786397117896653001,"uuid":"cf7c1189-1af7-4a1a-ab70-998b42f2f994"}